# vvaharness/remediation_agent/artifacts/report.py

Assembles the canonical per-finding case (`finding_case.json`) by joining the scan finding with this remediation attempt.

Source: `vvaharness/remediation_agent/artifacts/report.py` (lines 1-32)
Executor: code
Called from: `artifacts/writer.sudo` write_case

// src: vvaharness/remediation_agent/artifacts/report.py:24-32
fn build_report(target, remediation, reverted_paths=[]):executor=code {
  case_id = target.case_id
  finding = if (target.finding.case_id) target.finding else copy of target.finding with case_id   // a case file read on its own is self-describing
  return FindingCase(case_id, finding).with_attempt(remediation, reverted_paths)   // external: vvaharness/models (case state is derived there)
}
